          Just wanted to inform your page of a new event on the Luclin server....<br>
          <br>
          <br>
          Attention all Luclin citizens: <br>
          On this past Sunday night, a trade fair was held in NK at the wooden bridge, hosted by the Order of the Midnight Sun guild members. Many attended, and due to the encouragement of the people of Luclin, Order of the Midnight Sun presents, KaranaFest: A Gathering at the Bridge. It is to be at the Wooden Bridge in NK rain or shine, 10pm EST to Midnight EST, to trade, drink, and to bring together the people who cannot attend the already established trade in the Tunnel on Saturday afternoons. <br>
          <br>
          Please feel free to raid your bank(s), and bring all items, no matter how low level they are, for there were many newbies present on Sunday and many more are expected. Since it is difficult for all to bind in NK, dueling will be conducted at the Arena, a pleasant walk from the bridge, after most of the trading has been completed. <br>
          <br>
          Thank you, and hope to see you all there, <br>
          Dahija<br>
          Order of the Midnight Sun<br>
